    "control returns finite float u in [0,1] for y in [0,1], dt in [0.02,1.0], empty and populated state, no exception",
    "first call with y=0.2 initializes and returns u in [0.6,0.85] ramping, not 0 or 1 spike",
    "with steady y=0.6, output converges to 0.65-0.82 without oscillation >0.1",
    "with yf>0.80 output is capped <=0.45; with yf>0.70 output <= cap 0.78-2*(yf-0.65)",
